Exact syntax for every part of Typedown. Use these pages as a lookup when you know what you want but need the details.

- [Frontmatter](01-frontmatter): YAML frontmatter syntax, reserved keys, and type declarations
- [Markdown body](02-markdown-body): headings, formatting, math, code blocks, callouts, and custom components
- [Type system](03-type-system): type expressions, primitives, unions, and schema references
- [Icons](04-icons): the built-in page icon module
- [CLI](05-cli): `typerighter init`, `dev`, `build`, `preview`, and `check`

## Changelog

See the [changelog](https://github.com/huydo862003/typerighter/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) for release history.
